---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import DragonPearlCampaign from '../components/DragonPearlCampaign.astro';
---
<Layout editorial title="Creator Management & Brand Partnerships | Forge" description="Toronto creator management and brand partnerships. Meet Jayden AJ, explore his work and speak with Forge about your next collaboration.">
  <section class="forge-wrap forge-hero">
    <div class="forge-hero-grid">
      <div><p class="forge-kicker">Toronto · Creator management & brand partnerships</p><h1>People first.<br /><span class="editorial">Partnerships</span><br />that fit.</h1><p class="intro">Forge works with creators and brands on influencer marketing and brand partnerships. Meet the talent. Start a conversation.</p><div class="forge-actions"><a class="forge-button" href="/talent/">Explore talent <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="forge-link" href="/contact/">Discuss a partnership</a></div></div>
      <figure><img src="/assets/talent/jayden-burberry-portrait.jpg" alt="Jayden AJ in a light-blue outfit, photographed against a warm studio backdrop" width="900" height="1200" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption class="forge-caption"><span>Featured creator / Jayden AJ</span><span>Lifestyle · Beauty · Food</span></figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="forge-wrap forge-section forge-rule">
    <div class="forge-section-head"><p class="forge-kicker">What brings you here?</p><h2>A place for creators.<br /><span class="editorial">A partner for brands.</span></h2></div>
    <div class="forge-pair"><article class="forge-path" id="for-creators"><span class="forge-number">01 / For creators</span><h3>Your next chapter.</h3><p>Looking for a conversation about creator management? Tell us about your content and where you want to take it.</p><a class="forge-link" href="/contact/#creator-enquiry">Talk about management ↗</a></article><article class="forge-path" id="for-brands"><span class="forge-number">02 / For brands</span><h3>Start with the right fit.</h3><p>Explore Jayden’s profile, then share your campaign idea, timing and the kind of collaboration you have in mind.</p><a class="forge-link" href="/contact/#brand-enquiry">Discuss a brand partnership ↗</a></article></div>
  </section>
  <section class="forge-quiet"><div class="forge-wrap forge-section forge-feature"><a href="/talent/jayden-aj/" aria-label="Explore Jayden AJ’s creator profile"><img src="/assets/talent/jayden-alo-cyan.jpg" alt="Jayden AJ in a studio portrait against a cyan backdrop" width="900" height="1125" loading="lazy" /></a><div><p class="forge-kicker">Meet the talent</p><h2>Jayden <span class="editorial">AJ.</span></h2><p class="forge-tags">Toronto / Lifestyle, beauty & food</p><p>Get to know Jayden through his photography and public channels, with a direct route to Forge for partnership enquiries.</p><div class="forge-actions"><a class="forge-button" href="/talent/jayden-aj/">View creator profile ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
  <DragonPearlCampaign />
  <section class="forge-wrap forge-section forge-digital"><div><p class="forge-kicker">Also at Forge</p><h2>Digital<br /><span class="editorial">services.</span></h2></div><div><p>Website development, SEO and related services remain part of Forge. Explore the existing service pages for your business.</p><div style="margin-top:28px"><a href="/services/web-design/">Website development <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/services/search-forge/">SEO & search <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/services/content-forge/">Content services <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</Layout>
